==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Ponyta|21}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
*'''Combustion''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Destiny|Slugma|82}} from the {{TCG|Neo Destiny}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

